---
const PLAY_URL = "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.romel.gana4";
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
  <div
    class="glass relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] px-6 py-14 text-center sm:px-12"
  >
    <div
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/25 via-transparent to-cyan/20"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="relative">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">
        Descarga <span class="text-gradient">Gana4</span> gratis
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-txt-soft">
        Cuatro en línea, contra la máquina o con amigos en tu misma red. Sin registro y sin compras
        dentro de la app.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href={PLAY_URL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-2xl bg-accent px-7 py-4 font-display font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-accent/30 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent-soft hover:text-ink"
        >
          Consíguelo en Google Play
        </a>
        <a
          href="/terminos"
          class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 px-7 py-4 font-display font-semibold text-txt-soft transition hover:border-accent/60 hover:text-txt"
        >
          Términos de uso
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
